---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Headline facts for up to 100 threads with no bodies: subject, the latest sender, date and snippet, message and unread counts, and whether any message has an attachment. Unknown ids are left out

Usage: mxr thread-preview [OPTIONS] <THREAD_IDS>...

Arguments:
  <THREAD_IDS>...

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
